---
import mark from '../assets/mark.svg';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="description" content="Validate supplied 2-QWAC credentials and bind them to the TLS certificates served by Caddy or a dedicated Certbot/Nginx installation." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://qwacamole.com/" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <title>qwacamole — Identity bound to your TLS</title>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="qwacamole home"><img src={mark.src} width="34" height="34" alt="" />qwacamole<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="/overview/">Documentation</a>
      <a href="/project/licensing/">MIT license</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/cztamas/qwacamole">Source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
    <section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> EXPERIMENTAL · 0.1.0-alpha.1</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Your identity.<br />Bound to your <em>TLS.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead">Bring your 2-QWAC credential. Qwacamole connects it to the TLS certificates you actually serve, with Caddy or Certbot and Nginx.</p>
        <a class="primary-button" href="#integrations">Choose your integration <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <a class="text-link hero-docs" href="/overview/">Understand the binding <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="binding-figure">
        <p class="figure-label">ONE CONNECTION. TWO DISTINCT JOBS.</p>
        <div class="certificate"><span class="certificate-icon" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><span class="technical-label">OPERATOR-SUPPLIED 2-QWAC</span><strong>Organization identity</strong><p>Your certificate, chain and signing key.</p></div></div>
        <div class="binding-line"><span class="line"></span><span class="binding-pill"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m10 13 4-4m-6 7-2 2a4 4 0 0 1-6-6l4-4a4 4 0 0 1 6 0m4-2 2-2a4 4 0 1 1 6 6l-4 4a4 4 0 0 1-6 0" transform="translate(1 0)" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg> signed binding</span><span class="line"></span></div>
        <div class="certificate tls"><span class="certificate-icon" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><span class="technical-label">ORDINARY TLS CERTIFICATE</span><strong>The HTTPS connection</strong><p>The certificate presented to the browser.</p></div></div>
        <p class="figure-caption">Published and verified before TLS activation.<br />Discovered at <code>/bindings/current.jose</code>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="explanation wrap" aria-labelledby="explanation-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE CONNECTION BETWEEN THE TWO</p>
      <h2 id="explanation-title">Keep the identity.<br />Renew the connection.</h2>
      <div class="explanation-copy"><p>Your ordinary TLS certificate protects HTTPS. Your supplied 2-QWAC credential signs a document that binds your organization identity to that certificate.</p><p>Qwacamole manages the binding as TLS certificates renew. It retains coverage for held connections, refreshes independently and rejects new protected responses when a binding becomes unavailable.</p><a class="text-link" href="/operations/">Explore discovery and rebinding <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="integrations wrap" id="integrations" aria-labelledby="integrations-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR SERVER</p><h2 id="integrations-title">Two integrations.<br />One credential workflow.</h2></div><p>Explicit trust, local state and a supplied signing key. Choose the deployment you operate.</p></div>
      <div class="integration-grid">
        <article class="integration"><span class="integration-number">01 / CADDY</span><h3>Serve with packaged Caddy.</h3><p>The package includes a plugin that pairs a gated ACME issuer with binding discovery and HTTP middleware. Configure one hostname per state.</p><pre aria-label="Caddy directive example"><code is:raw>qwac.example.com {
    qwac { … }
    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8080
}</code></pre><p class="snippet-note">Directive shape; the quickstart includes the complete configuration.</p><a href="/caddy/quickstart/" class="integration-link">Caddy quickstart <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
        <article class="integration"><span class="integration-number">02 / CERTBOT + NGINX</span><h3>Gate the TLS deployment.</h3><p>A standalone agent for one dedicated Nginx master. Certbot's deploy hook publishes the binding before activating a TLS generation.</p><pre aria-label="Agent verification commands"><code>qwacamole-agent status \
  -config /etc/qwacamole/agent.json
qwacamole-agent check \
  -config /etc/qwacamole/agent.json</code></pre><p class="snippet-note">Private control and a fresh, normally verified TLS connection.</p><a href="/nginx/quickstart/" class="integration-link">Certbot / Nginx quickstart <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="credential-section wrap" aria-labelledby="credential-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">BRING YOUR OWN CREDENTIAL</p><h2 id="credential-title">Start locally.<br />Keep your key local.</h2><p>Prepare a dedicated RSA key and CSR. Once an issuer supplies the certificate, inspect its profile, hostname coverage, key match and chain against your explicitly selected authority.</p><a class="text-link" href="/credentials/">Prepare, inspect and import <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Create a key and signed CSR with the production CLI.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Validate</h3><p>Check the supplied 2-QWAC and chain before activation.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Operate</h3><p>Renew TLS and replace credentials without dropping coverage.</p></div></li></ol></section>
    <aside class="status wrap" aria-labelledby="status-title"><span class="status-dot"></span><div><h2 id="status-title">Experimental, with explicit boundaries.</h2><p>The source repository and experimental 0.1.0-alpha.1 release are public. Follow the installation guide to download and verify the packages. Local authority validation does not establish EU trusted-list qualification, revocation status or browser trust. Qwacamole does not enroll for qualified certificates.</p><a class="text-link" href="/support/">Supported configurations and browser limitations <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></aside>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap"><a class="brand" href="/">qwacamole.</a><p>Supplied credentials. Verified bindings. Explicit trust.</p><nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/project/licensing/">License</a><a href="/support/">Compatibility</a><a href="/demonstration/">Demonstrations</a><a href="/project/security/">Security</a><a href="https://github.com/cztamas/qwacamole/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contribute</a></nav><p class="footer-note">Original code: MIT. Public source repository.</p></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style is:global>
  :root{color-scheme:light;--paper:#f6f5ee;--ink:#173c31;--muted:#50645c;--line:#d9dfd4;--accent:#c6d8ac}
  *{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:2rem}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #865211;outline-offset:5px;border-radius:3px}.wrap{max-width:1192px;margin:auto;padding-left:40px;padding-right:40px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-100px;left:12px;z-index:10;background:white;padding:12px}.skip:focus{top:12px}.site-header{max-width:1192px;margin:auto;padding:27px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:750;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:-1px;text-decoration:none}.brand-dot{margin-left:-10px}.site-header nav,footer nav{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.site-header nav a,footer nav a{text-decoration:none}.site-header nav a:hover,footer nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr 1fr;gap:55px;align-items:center;padding-top:84px;padding-bottom:94px}.eyebrow,.technical-label,.figure-label,.integration-number{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px}.eyebrow{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 24px}.status-dot{display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#6a7c33}h1,h2{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.07;margin:0}h1{font-size:clamp(58px,6.4vw,82px)}h1 em{font-weight:400}h2{font-size:46px}h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.5px}.lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:480px;line-height:1.65;margin:27px 0 30px}.primary-button{display:inline-flex;gap:25px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:14px 21px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.primary-button:hover{background:#275342}.text-link{font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.hero-docs{display:block;margin-top:18px}.binding-figure{background:#e9ede1;border:1px solid #d8dfcc;border-radius:8px;padding:29px 27px}.figure-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1.2px;margin:0 0 27px;color:var(--muted)}.certificate{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:17px;background:#fafbf5;border:1px solid #cfd8c5;border-radius:5px;padding:22px 19px;box-shadow:0 3px 0 #d8dfcc}.certificate-icon{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:27px;line-height:1.4;color:#6d8160}.technical-label{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:7px}.certificate strong{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:23px;line-height:1.2}.certificate p{font-size:12px;margin:7px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.binding-line{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}.line{height:18px;border-left:1px solid #a3b594}.binding-pill{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:11px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid #adbe9e;border-radius:20px;padding:5px 11px;background:#dee7cf}.figure-caption{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:24px 0 0;line-height:1.8}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.88em}.explanation{border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 90px;padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:65px}.explanation .eyebrow{grid-column:1/-1}.explanation-copy p:first-child{margin-top:0}.explanation-copy{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted)}.explanation-copy p{margin-bottom:18px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:45px;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:38px}.section-heading>p{max-width:290px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0}.integrations{padding-top:57px;padding-bottom:70px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.integration-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}.integration{padding:32px;border:1px solid #cbd5c5;border-radius:6px;background:#eef0e6;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.integration-number{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.integration h3{margin:19px 0 12px}.integration>p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 23px}.integration pre{margin:0;background:#173c31;color:#eef3e7;padding:22px;border-radius:4px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;overflow-x:auto}.integration .snippet-note{font-size:11px;margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:25px}.integration-link{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-top:auto;border-top:1px solid #cbd5c5;padding-top:20px}.integration-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.credential-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:90px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:55px;padding-bottom:70px}.credential-section>div>p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);max-width:430px;margin:25px 0}.credential-section ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}.credential-section li{display:flex;gap:26px;padding:21px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.credential-section li>span{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;color:#50644a;font-size:12px;padding-top:3px}.credential-section h3{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 8px}.credential-section li p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.status{margin-bottom:60px;background:#e9ede1;border:1px solid #d8dfcc;border-radius:6px;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px;display:flex;gap:18px}.status>.status-dot{margin-top:10px}.status h2{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.5px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:600}.status p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);max-width:920px;margin:10px 0 15px}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:25px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer>.brand{font-size:21px}footer>p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}footer nav{gap:19px;font-size:12px}footer .footer-note{flex-basis:100%;font-size:11px}
  @media(max-width:800px){.wrap,.site-header{padding-left:24px;padding-right:24px}.site-header{gap:20px}.site-header nav{gap:17px;font-size:12px}.brand{font-size:21px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;padding-top:48px;padding-bottom:48px}.hero-copy{max-width:560px}.hero h1{font-size:64px}.binding-figure{max-width:520px}.explanation,.credential-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px}.explanation .eyebrow{margin-bottom:0}.explanation{padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px}.section-heading{display:block}.section-heading>p{max-width:500px;margin-top:22px}.integration-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.integrations{padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:45px}.credential-section{padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:45px}.status{margin-left:24px;margin-right:24px;padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.status h2{font-size:18px}footer nav{gap:16px}h2{font-size:39px}}
  @media(max-width:430px){.site-header{padding-top:19px;padding-bottom:19px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px}.site-header nav{width:100%;justify-content:space-between}.hero h1{font-size:55px}.lead{font-size:17px}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px}.binding-figure{padding:23px 17px}.certificate{padding:19px 14px;gap:12px}.certificate strong{font-size:21px}.figure-label{font-size:9px}.integration{padding:24px}.integration pre{padding:17px;font-size:11px}.credential-section{gap:25px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
